a 3899edf4,d4928773,41396457. Halide proof and polyamide/whole-polycondensation scope are not obligations of this particular alcohol-monomer clause. All current edges are partial; that qualification is legitimate and must not become a full-union official-credit claim.","specificDelta":"Restore the original LK course qualifier in source authority; restrict full-clause source credit to the mechanism/monomer carrier. Keep any useful broader SkillPilot targets with their separate authority; do not remove GK polycondensation merely because this clause is LK.","projectionObservation":"The current BB LK view directly targets c3077d95; BB GK does not. Both directly target 9b942490. This avoids claiming a demonstrated runtime LK-to-GK leak; extraction course fidelity still needs revision.","primaryPages":[30,33]}
