stage8/Einblick scope, and provide an explicitly bound current experimental indicator carrier/profile route before full source duty acceptance. Alternatively an explicitly narrower source facet could be reviewed separately, but silently discarding the left mandatory experimental sub-duty is not acceptable. Retain actual experimental HOLD; do not satisfy it with source hashes, D/P keep or hypothetical paper performance.","primaryPages":[4,24]}
